  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Sending_Required_Diagnostic_Data\Subtitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: As a part of using Windows, your device sends Microsoft a limited set of data that is necessary to keep your device and operating system secure, up to date, and working as expected.
