  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_HoloLens_Utilities_Calibration\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᎢᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎦᏘ ᏓᏙᎵᎬᎢ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_HoloLens_Utilities_CalibrationDescription\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏍᏛ ᎢᎬᏁᏗ HoloLens ᏘᎦᏙᎵ. ᎯᎠ ᎪᏢᎯᏏᏍᎪ ᎦᏙ ᎯᎵᎦᎵᏯ ᎠᎪᏩᏛᏗ ᎢᏤᏳᏍᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏱᏘᎪᎵᏰᎠ ᎤᎪᏗ ᏙᎯᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎣᏍᏕᎵᏍᎪ ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏂᏚᏓᎷᎸᎾ ᏗᎵᎪᎲᏍᎩ. ᏫᏓᏤᏢ ᏄᎵᏍᏙᏗ, ᎠᎢᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎦᏘ ᏓᏙᎵᎬᎢ ᏌᏊᎭ ᎠᏟᎢᎵᏒ ᎢᏤ ᏴᏫ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_Uninstall\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Uninstall Windows Mixed Reality
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallWarning\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᏓᎷᎸ ᏥᎯᏘᏅᏛᎦ, ᏙᏳᎢ ᏅᎦ ᎱᏓᎳᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏟᏳᏦᎾᏗᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ PC ᎠᎴ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᎤᎵᏑᏱ ᎤᏙᎯᏳᏄᏍᏛ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗᎢ.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallDescription\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏳᏃ Windows ᏗᎫᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎣᏤᎵᎪᎯ ᎥᏝ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏯᎢ, ᎠᎴᏱᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏣᎵᏅᏓᏗᏍᏗᎢ ᎢᎦᏓ ᎠᏠᏓᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ, ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏱᏘᏅᏕᎦ. ᎯᎠᏃ ᏱᏓᎲᎾ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏅᎢ ᎠᎴ ᏭᎷᎯᏍᏗ Windows ᏗᎫᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎣᏤᎵᎪᎯ ᎥᎿ ᎠᏠᏓᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎤᏓᎷᎸᎢ ᎦᏘᏅᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᏗᎫᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎣᏤᎵᎪᎯ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏂᏚᏍᏕᏍᏗ ᎥᎿ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ. 

ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎬᎢ Windows ᏗᎫᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎣᏤᎵᎪᎯ ᎠᏏᏉ, ᎡᏅᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏗᎢ > ᏗᎫᎵᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎣᏤᎵᎪᎯ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗ.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallDescription2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: If Windows Mixed Reality isn’t working well or if you want to free up disk space, uninstall and then install it again (go to Start and select Mixed Reality Portal). Your user info will be removed when uninstalling, but your mixed reality apps will remain on your PC.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_ClearDataDescription\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Your device captures your environment to give you the best possible experience.

If you clear this data, some app content may disappear from your environment and you’ll no longer see the boundary you set up. To create the boundary again, on your PC go to Start > Mixed Reality Portal > Run setup.
