  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ Windows ᏗᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᎦᎵᎶᎦ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎥᎿ ᏗᎦᎶᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏕᎫᎪᏔᏅᎯ. ᎠᎵᏍᏚᎲᏍᎬ ᎯᎠ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᎭᏂ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏯᏍᏆᎶᎩ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ Windows ᏱᎾᏛᎦ. 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Let desktop apps access your microphone
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Desktop apps that have previously accessed your microphone are listed here
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Choose which apps can access your microphone
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎦᏓ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏂᏙᏗ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎦᏬᏂᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎥᎿ ᏗᎦᎶᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ Ꮎ ᎮᎵᏍᎬᎢ. ᎯᏍᏚᎲᏍᎬ ᎤᏍᏗ ᎬᏂᏙᏗ ᎡᎷᏊᏍ ᏱᏩᏎᎦ ᎢᏳᏛᏂᏗᎢ.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Allow apps to read messages
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: If you allow access, you can choose which apps can read messages via text by using the settings on this page. Denying access blocks apps from reading texts.
