  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_WindowsAndServicesGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Let Windows and App Services access your location
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_WindowsAndServicesGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows and App Services that have previously accessed your location are listed here
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᎨᏨᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎯᎠ ᎤᎦᏅᏓᏛᎢ ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎡᎵᏊ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎠᎴ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏂᏧᎵᏍᏔᏅᏍᏔᏅ ᏛᏍᎦᏂ-ᏗᎬᎳᏏᏗ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏗᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏙᏯ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ. ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᏣᏙᎥ ᎰᏪᎸᎦ Microsoft ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ, ᎣᏂ ᏗᎪᎵᎩ ᎮᏙᎲᎢ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏔᏅ ᎥᎿ ᎤᎶᎩᎸᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎠᏯᏙᏍᏗᎢ ᏗᏐ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎭᏢ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᏣᏙᎥ ᎰᏪᎸᎦ ᏣᏤᎵ Microsoft ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ. ᎠᏓᏱᎯ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏱᎪᏪᎳ ᎾᎿ ᎯᎠ ᎤᎦᏅᏓᏛᎢ ᏓᏴᏍᏗᎲ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Let apps access your location
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: All apps can access approximate location, but you can choose which apps can access your precise location
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UsageHistory_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: See which apps have accessed your location in the last 7 days 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎾᎿ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗ Windows ᏨᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎢᎬᏩᏛᏁᏗ ᏗᎫᎪᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎠᎴ Microsoft ᏱᎬᏓ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᎪᏢᎯᏍᏅ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏧᎾᏓᏍᏕᎸᏗᎢ. ᏴᏫ ᎠᏗᏍᎬ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏱᏂᎬᎲᎦ ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏧᎾᏤᎵ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏱᏣᎭ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎥᎬᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎯᎠ ᎤᎦᏅᏓᏛᎢ. ᎠᏓᏱᎯ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎦᏐᎾᎳᏗᏍᎨᏍᏗ Windows ᏂᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅ ᎠᎾᏓᏁᎳᏍᎬ ᎤᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ Windows ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ, Microsoft Store ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᎢᎦᏓ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_TurnOffButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Turn off
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_Link\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Learn more
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_Dialog_Title:
