  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BluetoothSync_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏁᎳᎩ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏂᏙᏗ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏩᏙᎵᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎢᏧᎳ ᎧᏃᎮᏓ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛᎾ ᏗᎬᏂᏙᏗ Ꮭ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᏯᎾᎵᎪᎲᎦ ᏣᏤᎵ PC, ᎪᏪᎶᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏗᎵᏃᎮᏗ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BluetoothSync_UserGlobal_ExamplesText\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏓᏅ: ᏗᏨᏍᏗ ᏗᏕᏲᎯ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BluetoothSync_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᏧᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎨᎵᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏮᏙᏟᏍᏗ ᏂᏓᏏᎳᏛᎾ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏗᏓᏂ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎥᏝ ᏗᏙᏟᎩ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ PC, ᎠᏱᏓᏍᏗ, Ꭰ.ᏱᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗᎢ. ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᎢ ᏱᏛᏯᏙᎯᏏ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏗᏓᏂ.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BluetoothSync_AppListLink\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎨᎵᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ ᏗᎵᎪᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᏥᏂᏕᎬᏗᏓᎾ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎣᏂ ᏗᏜ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎠ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ, ᏂᎯ ᎡᎵᏊ ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏱᏣᎭ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᎯᎲᎾ ᏍᎦᏍᎦᏂ, ᏗᏉᏰᏂ, ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎲ ᎢᎾ ᏂᏓᎧᏁᎩ, ᎠᎴ ᏗᏐᎢ tracked ᎪᎱᏍᏗ, ᎾᎯᏳ Ꮎ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏓᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏜ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎥᎬᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎯᎠ ᎤᎦᏅᏓᏛᎢ. ᎠᏓᏱᎯ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏓᏴᏍᏗᎲ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎠ ᎾᎯᏳ Ꮎ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏓᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏜ.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎣᏂ ᏗᏜ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎠ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏳᏃ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᏗ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ, ᏴᏫ ᎠᏗᏍᎬ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᏱᏂᎬᎲᎦ ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᎢᏳᏃ ᏧᎾᏤᎵ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏱᏣᎭ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᎯᎲᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᎪᎵ, ᏗᏉᏰᏂ, ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎲ ᎢᎾ ᏂᏓᎧᏁᎩ, ᎠᎴ ᏗᏐᎢ tracked ᎪᎱᏍᏗ, ᎾᎯᏳ Ꮎ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏓᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏜ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎥᎬᏗᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᎿ ᎯᎠ ᎤᎦᏅᏓᏛᎢ. ᎠᏓᏱᎯ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏓᏴᏍᏗᎲ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏴᏫ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎠ ᎾᎯᏳ Ꮎ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᏓᎢ ᎣᏂᏗᏜ.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎡᎵᏊ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎠ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏛᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎦᏓ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏂᏙᏗ ᎦᎵᎶᎦ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎠ ᎾᎯᏳ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏛᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ ᎣᎾᏗᏢ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅ ᎥᎿ ᏗᎦᎶᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᏕᎫᎪᏔᏅᎯ. ᎠᎵᏍᏚᎲᏍᎬ ᎬᏔᏂᏓᏍᏗ ᎠᎭᏂ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏯᏍᏆᎶᎩ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏛᏁᏗᎢ.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_AppSilo_EmptyListDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: After installing isolated Win32 applications, they will show up here
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_AppSilo_CompletedDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Consent was reset
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_AppSilo:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Reset file permissions on isolated Win32 applications
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_AppRequestedDownloads_MainHeading\Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows can automatically download files from your online storage provider for apps that request them. If you block any of those apps from requesting automatic file downloads, you can allow them to make requests again here.
